The horizontal line meets the curve symmetrically about the minimum at $x=5$.

$\begin{aligned}x&=2(5)-\frac53\\&=\frac{25}{3}\end{aligned}$

Add the period $10$ to each solution.

$\begin{aligned}&\mathrel{\phantom{=}}\frac53+10\\&=\frac{35}{3}\end{aligned}$

$\begin{aligned}&\mathrel{\phantom{=}}\frac{25}{3}+10\\&=\frac{55}{3}\end{aligned}$

All four values lie in the domain:

$x=\frac53,\frac{25}{3},\frac{35}{3},\frac{55}{3}$.

